* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
** --------------------------------------------------------------------
** Subprogram  NODATF-N
** Version    2.2.1
** Function   NOM API : using date in selected format
**
** XSETGGR 2001-08-01   created
** --------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA PARAMETER
1 #DATE-8          (A8)      /* input
1 #DATE-10         (A10)     /* output
1 #FORMAT          (A1)      /* input
LOCAL
1 #DATE            (D)
END-DEFINE
IF #DATE-8 = ' '
  RESET #DATE-10
ELSE
  MOVE EDITED #DATE-8  TO #DATE (EM=YYYYMMDD)
  IF #FORMAT = ' '
    MOVE EDITED #DATE (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD) TO #DATE-10
  END-IF
  DECIDE ON FIRST VALUE OF #FORMAT
    VALUE 'I','J'
      MOVE EDITED #DATE (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD) TO #DATE-10
    VALUE 'E','F'
      MOVE EDITED #DATE (EM=DD'/'MM'/'YYYY) TO #DATE-10
    VALUE 'G','H'
      MOVE EDITED #DATE (EM=DD'.'MM'.'YYYY) TO #DATE-10
    VALUE 'A','B'
      MOVE EDITED #DATE (EM=MM'/'DD'/'YYYY) TO #DATE-10
    NONE VALUE IGNORE
  END-DECIDE
END-IF
END
